        "title": "Optional: relay control and web login",
        "description": "Everything here is optional; leave it empty to start read-only. You can change it later with the gear icon on the integration.\n\n**Relay control** needs both the checkbox and the SNMP write community. Without them, outlets are read-only binary sensors.\n\n**Web login** adds what SNMP doesn't provide (lifetime energy, firmware version, external sensors, the device event log). It's only used for reads.",
